  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7e3f6a2-1111-4c2d-9a4e-siakaduts01",
    "name": "SIAKAD Mini - UTS PBE",
    "description": "Koleksi pengujian 10 endpoint SIAKAD Mini, berurutan sesuai nomor pada soal.\n\nPersiapan:\n1. Reset database: TRUNCATE enrollments, students, courses, users RESTART IDENTITY CASCADE; lalu jalankan ulang migrations/002_seed.sql.\n2. Jalankan server siakad-mini.\n3. Jalankan folder 1 berurutan: lima login pertama menyimpan token otomatis ke variabel koleksi.\n\nCatatan rate limiter: maksimal 5 permintaan login per menit per IP. Bila muncul 429, tunggu satu menit.",
